//! ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country codes for Mollie request fields.
//!
//! Each entry is the ISO 3166-1 **alpha-2** code. English short names
//! follow the ISO 3166 Maintenance Agency (ISO 3166/MA). Optional
//! subdivision summaries describe categories coded in **ISO 3166-2**
//! (not full subdivision code lists).
//!
//! Mollie documents country fields (billing country, address `country`,
//! etc.) as ISO 3166-1 alpha-2. Generated OpenAPI types often keep these
//! as plain strings; validate with [`CountryCode`] first.
//!
//! See `docs/iso/iso-3166-1-alpha-2.md`.
//!
//! Regenerated by `scripts/generate_country_code.py`.
